                    <p>.NET backend with a React frontend on SQL Server. Visitors register for travel fair and simulator sessions through validated forms, slots enforce capacity so sessions cannot be oversubscribed, and each registration produces a confirmation record. Staff get a consolidated view of registrations per session to prepare rosters and manage walk-ins on the day.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

