                    <p>Django REST backend with a React and TypeScript frontend on PostgreSQL. Tenant-scoped data isolation keeps every garage's customers, vehicles, and stock separate. It covers the full service lifecycle &mdash; appointment booking, job card assignment, parts consumption from inventory, supplier purchase orders, invoicing, payment capture, and expense tracking &mdash; with dashboards for revenue, technician workload, and stock movement.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

