                <div class="project-icon">
                    <i class="fas fa-comments"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="project-title">Call Center Chatbot</h3>
                <p class="project-description">Digitally enabled call-center support solution improving service delivery and customer interaction workflows.</p>
                <ul class="project-features">
                    <li>Digital service support</li>
                    <li>Workflow automation</li>
                    <li>Customer interaction logic</li>
                    <li>Operational efficiency</li>
