                <div class="project-details">
                    <p>A digital support layer for the contact centre that handles common customer enquiries through guided conversation flows, routes anything outside its scope to a live agent with the conversation context attached, and logs interactions so recurring questions can be turned into self-service answers.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="project-card">
                <div class="project-icon">
                    <i class="fas fa-code-branch"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="project-title">Genesys APIs</h3>
                <p class="project-description">Secure REST API integrations for data exchange and system connectivity with Genesys-based operational workflows.</p>
                <ul class="project-features">
                    <li>REST APIs</li>
                    <li>Secure data exchange</li>
                    <li>System integration</li>
                    <li>Business connectivity</li>
                </ul>
                <div class="project-tech">
