                </button>
                <div class="project-details">
                    <p>C# REST services that broker data between Genesys contact-centre workflows and internal operational systems. They cover authenticated endpoints, request validation, payload mapping between the two domains, and structured logging so integration failures are traceable rather than silent.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="project-card">
                <div class="project-icon">
                    <i class="fas fa-globe"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="project-title">Globify.bh</h3>
                <p class="project-description">Full-stack website built with Laravel Livewire, Blade, Tailwind CSS, Flux UI, SQLite, and GitHub-based workflow practices.</p>
                <ul class="project-features">
                    <li>Laravel Livewire frontend</li>
                    <li>Tailwind styling</li>
