                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="project-card">
                <div class="project-icon">
                    <i class="fas fa-wallet"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="project-title">Finance Tracker</h3>
                <p class="project-description">Personal finance web app for budgeting, expense tracking, and financial analytics.</p>
                <ul class="project-features">
                    <li>Expense monitoring</li>
                    <li>Budget planning</li>
                    <li>Financial analytics</li>
                    <li>User-friendly dashboards</li>
                </ul>
                <div class="project-tech">
